# Untracked working files, which the handoff, doc-review and update-deps commands and ad hoc reviews
# write to the repository root. They are scratch rather than documentation, and a local
# `markdownlint --fix` run would otherwise rewrite them.
#
# The leading slash anchors each pattern to the repository root. Without it these would also match
# the tracked home/.claude/commands/handoff.md and doc-review.md, since the matching is
# case-insensitive.
/*DOC-REVIEW.md
/*-REVIEW*.md
/*HANDOFF.md
/*IMPACT.md
/*PLAN.md
/*local-review*.md
